OL,3,GNEWSAControversial #16m revamp of Burns
OL,4,AStatue Square approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA multi-million pound transformation of
OL,7,Fan Ayrshire landmark has been approved
OL,8,Fdespite concerns over the impact on
OL,9,Fbusinesses and the wider town.
OL,11,FSouth Ayrshire Council backed the final
OL,12,Fdesigns for the major regeneration of
OL,13,FBurns Statue Square in Ayr by 19 votes
OL,14,Fto four, clearing the way for
OL,15,Fconstruction to begin in January.
OL,17,FThe scheme aims to turn the
OL,18,Ftraffic-dominated square into a new
OL,19,Fcivic space and gateway to the town
OL,20,Fcentre, creating more room for
OL,21,Fpedestrians, landscaping and seating.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
